# Review ownership. GitHub requests a review from the owner automatically when a pull
# request touches a matching path. Combine with branch protection on main (require the
# "Build manuals" check and one approving review) to make these owners effective.
#
# TODO(łukasz): replace @ftd-aero/support-lead with the real GitHub handle or team.
# Until a real account or team exists here, GitHub silently requests nobody.

# Component identity: a new or renamed component id needs the Support lead.
components/*/component.yaml   @ftd-aero/support-lead

# Device configuration: what is installed on a simulator, and the manual's issue/revision.
sims/                         @ftd-aero/support-lead

# Chapter structure of a manual type.
templates/                    @ftd-aero/support-lead

# Build tooling and authoring rules.
tools/                        @ftd-aero/support-lead
CLAUDE.md                     @ftd-aero/support-lead
.github/                      @ftd-aero/support-lead
